# Docs — private / WIP / archived.
# NOTE: docs/documentation/ is intentionally NOT ignored — the web app build-imports
# it (import.meta.glob '@docs/documentation/0[0-9]-*/*.md' + INDEX.md?raw). A blanket
# `docs/` ignore breaks the Vercel build (ENOENT on the ?raw import). Ignore only the
# private/vault subtrees below.
docs/a-torg/
docs/reference/
docs/reports/
docs/documentation/archive/
docs/documentation/XX-cms-projects-unlogged-to-docs
docs/archive

